"""HTTP server for Nivrael — bot health, mini-app static files, marketing
website static files, and the authenticated /api/miniapp/* JSON API.

Replaces the old hand-rolled asyncio HTTP server in main.py. Built on aiohttp
because we need real routing, middleware (HMAC auth), and to serve a full
SPA build directory instead of a single file.

Security: every /api/miniapp/* endpoint validates Telegram WebApp initData
HMAC against BOT_TOKEN before any DB lookup. Without the bot token, a forged
init_data cannot be produced.
"""
