    """READ — v16.1 compact lineage state for the caller's sect.

    Useful for chat-side deep-links + sect war drilldowns where the full
    SectTab payload would be overkill. Returns NULL fields when the
    caller isn't in a sect (UI shows the "join/create" CTA instead).
    """
